陽昭陽二殿"},{"column":"20R09","pdf_page":20,"half":"右","leaf":"17下","column_from_right":9,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20","start":0,"end":18,"text":"太后皇后所居也永明中無太后皇后羊貴嬪"},{"column":"20L01","pdf_page":20,"half":"左","leaf":"18上","column_from_right":1,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20","start":0,"end":18,"text":"居昭陽殿西范貴妃居昭陽殿東寵姬荀昭華"},{"column":"20L02","pdf_page":20,"half":"左","leaf":"18上","column_from_right":2,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20","start":0,"end":18,"text":"居鳳華栢殿宮內御所居壽昌畫殿南閣置白"},{"column":"20L03","pdf_page":20,"half":"左","leaf":"18上","column_from_right":3,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20","start":0,"end":18,"text":"鷺鼓吹二部乾光殿東西頭置鍾磬兩廂皆宴"},{"column":"20L04","pdf_page":20,"half":"左","leaf":"18上","column_from_right":4,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20","start":0,"end":18,"text":"樂處也上數游幸諸苑囿載宮人從後車宮內"},{"column":"20L05","pdf_page":20,"half":"左","leaf":"18上","column_from_right":5,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20","start":0,"end":18,"text":"深隱不聞端門鼓漏聲置鍾於景陽樓上應五"},{"column":"20L06","pdf_page":20,"half":"左","leaf":"18上","column_from_right":6,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20","start":0,"end":18,"text":"鼓及三鼓宮人聞鍾聲早起莊飾車駕數幸琅"},{"column":"20L07","pdf_page":20,"half":"左","leaf":"18上","column_from_right":7,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20","start":0,"end":18,"text":"邪城宮人常從早發至湖北埭雞始鳴故呼為"},{"column":"20L08","pdf_page":20,"half":"左","leaf":"18上","column_from_right":8,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20","start":0,"end":3,"text":"雞鳴埭"}]},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-peihuizhao-izumo","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-peihuizhao-izumo"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-peihuizhao:p004","text":"舊顯陽、昭陽二殿，太后皇后所居也。永明中無太后皇后，羊貴嬪居昭陽殿西，范貴妃居昭陽殿東，寵姬荀昭華居鳳華柏殿。宮內禦所居壽昌畫殿南閣，置白鷺鼓吹二部，幹光殿東西頭，置鍾磬兩廂，皆宴樂處也。上數游幸諸苑囿，載宮人從后車。宮內深隱，不聞端門鼓漏聲，置鍾于景陽樓上，應五鼓及三鼓。宮人聞鐘聲，早起莊飾。車駕數幸琅邪城，宮人常從，早發，至湖北埭，雞始鳴，故呼為雞鳴埭。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-011-peihuizhao:p004:m0026","person_id":"wu6_k7p_4dn","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"羊","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依該段姓名及上下文。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-peihuizhao:p004:m0035","person_id":"xbm_e9e_uv2","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"范","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依該段姓名及上下文。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-peihuizhao:p004:m0046","person_id":"xon_sxb_cqq","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"荀","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依該段姓名及上下文。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2288359,"first_line":110,"last_line":110,"line_start":0,"line_end":180,"raw_start":6971,"raw_end":7151,"raw_character_offsets":[6971,6972,6973,6974,6975,6976,6977,6978,6979,6980,6981,6982,6983,6984,6985,6986,6987,6988,6989,6990,6991,6992,6993,6994,6995,6996,6997,6998,6999,7000,7001,7002,7003,7004,7005,7006,7007,7008,7009,7010,7011,7012,7013,7014,7015,7016,7017,7018,7019,7020,7021,7022,7023,7024,7025,7026,7027,7028,7029,7030,7031,7032,7033,7034,7035,7036,7037,7038,7039,7040,7041,7042,7043,7044,7045,7046,7047,7048,7049,7050,7051,7052,7053,7054,7055,7056,7057,7058,7059,7060,7061,7062,7063,7064,7065,7066,7067,7068,7069,7070,7071,7072,7073,7074,7075,7076,7077,7078,7079,7080,7081,7082,7083,7084,7085,7086,7087,7088,7089,7090,7091,7092,7093,7094,7095,7096,7097,7098,7099,7100,7101,7102,7103,7104,7105,7106,7107,7108,7109,7110,7111,7112,7113,7114,7115,7116,7117,7118,71